<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Sagala Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Galatiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluva ya Pawulo kwa Vagalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt1">Baluva ya Pawulo kwa Vagalatiya</para>
  <para style="mt">Baluva ya Pawulo kwa VAGALATIYA</para>
  <para style="imt">Wulongolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluva kwa Vagalatiya yo yandikwe na Mutumi Pawulo Musula ya 1:1 Baluva yino Pawulo avandichilye vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito wo vavaga uko ku muji gwa Galatiya, hagati ha mwaka gwa 48 na 57 hoavaga mwanga aleliche Yesu Chilisito. Yin'woneka kuta Vagalatiya vikalaga ha muji mukomi gwa Galatiya, gogwavaga mu wutavala wa muvina va inyi ya Lumi. Vanu wovasomile ndongwa tsa Mandiko ga Mulungu vavaga sivan'tsela nachene kuta Pawulo avaga hono hachi hoandikaga baluva yino, Yifuluche baluva yino yandichilwe ku muji gwa Efweso awu ku Kolindo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawulo hoandikaga baluva yino aganaga yibite kwa Vayawudi na wosi Vayawudi veka vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito wo vikalaga ku Galatiya. Chinu chikomi cho chamwambutse andiche baluva yino aganaga avatanje vanu iwo valeche kufwata madahitso ga wudesi, go gavadahitsaga vanya litumbilo kuta vafwate malajitso ga Chiyawudi go gali mu Lilagano lya Katali, na chinu chikomi chavaga ndongwa tsa kwinjila likumbi. Kwavaga na chikundi cha vanu mugati mwa vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito wo vichemaga Vayuda wo wavagwagwaditsaga vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito wosi Vayawudi vinjile likumbi. Kaha vanu iwo vaputsanitsaga mamulaka cha chitumi ga mutumi Pawulo ga humile kwiya. Pawulo angiyamila kwajili ya wutumi wake kwa kweletsela ndongwa tsake mwene nunga mu sula ya 1:11-2:14, na ipamanilaga Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu tso avaga mwanga avikwe, avalonjelaga kuta wukuluso wuhumilaga kwa kumutumba hela Yesu Chilisito mu sula ya 2:16. Wukulusi wo wuwuya wa Mulungu wo anguwulajila kwa vanu na kuta wukulusi siwutsaga kwa ng'olwa tsa vanu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa tsotsili muchitabu chino.</para>
  <para style="io">Pawulo ankwantsa baluva yake kwa kuvasamusa vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito wo vali Kugalatiya musula ya 1:1-5.</para>
  <para style="io">Kahi Pawulo ankweletsela ndongwa tsake mwene tsa katali ili ipamanile kula kudichilwe kwake kwa katsi ya kudahitsa na kuta ajetsitse kikala kwa kufwata malajitso ga Musa, lechelelo akalemulwe musula ya 1:6-2:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Kahi ankweletsela ndalahela kuhusu malajitso ga Musa na wuwuya wa Mulungu fina katsi yachi mu wukulusi musula ya 3-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Pawulo ankwendelela kuvalonjela vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito hila fyo van'ganika kiyangalila kikala kwa kudita ndongwa nofu mu litumbilo lya Chilisito mu sula 5-6:10.</para>
  <para style="io">Pawulo ansinda baluva yake kwa kuvasamusa na kuvasuka viwukaje kuta kupitulwa na Mulungu na kuditwa kuva munu mupya ifyo fyo finu fyofin'ganika ndalahela kulutila malajitso ga Musa na hila fyo van'woneka kwa kivala, kota fyoguli muhwano gwa kwinjila likumbi musula ya 6:11-18.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Heni mutumi Pawulo yo ntsandiche baluva yino, yo sintsili mutumi va vanu, na sintsatumilwe na vanu. Ila numilwe kwa wuvetso va Yesu Chilisito, na wa Dada Mulungu yo amutsilipwe Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Heni hamwe na vanu veka wo vali hamwe na heni tunguvasamusa henye vanu veka vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito wo muli ku Galatiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Tunguvasuchila kwa Mulungu Dada vetu na kwa Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito avapele henye wuwuya na wusichimafu. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Chilisito yo idiche kitawula wumi wake kwasawuli kutuhetsela ndongwa tsetu ntsibi ili atukuluse kuhuma mu inyi yino ya ndongwa ntsibi, kota fyo an'gana mwene yo Mulungu na Dada vetu. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Mulungu atsumitswaje siku tseka bila wudugo. Tavile!<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuna Ndongwa Nofu yimwe hela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Momwiche ndalahela hila fyo munsupanitsa kuyileka Ndongwa Nofu ya Chilisito na kwantsa kufwata ndongwa nofu tsinji. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Siyo kuta kweli iyo yo ndongwa nofu, ila kwa wukweli kovali vanu wo vanguvayuganitsa wo van'gana kutsipitula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Chilisito. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Lechelelo nayivaje hetwe awu munu yoyuve yo ali hagati henyu, awu mutantsi va kilanga kwa Mulungu, manyi avavikulile henye ndongwa nofu yoyive yo yili finji na yila yo twavavikulye hetwe, duve munu uyo akotolwaje. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Kota fyo twalongwe kuvalonjela, na sambi ntsinguvalonjela kanji kuta, manyi munu yoyuve yo akuvavikulila henye ndongwa nofu yinji yoyive, yoyili finji na yila yo mwanuchilye kuhuma kwa hetwe, munu uyo akotokaje na Mulungu. <verse eid="GAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Mbe, lelo sambi ntsin'gana kidichilwa na vanu awu na Mulungu? Awu ntsin'gana kuvagan'ya vanu? Ntsika ntsive ntsin'gana kuvagan'ya vanu, si ntsika kuva mutantsi va Chilisito.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo anlonga hila fyo achemilwe ave mutumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Nyee vang'olotsangu, ntsin'gana mutselaje kuta yila Ndongwa Nofu yo ntsavavikulye, siyavaga yihumye kwa vanu. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Heni sintsanuchilye Ndongwa Nofu itso kuhuma kwa munu, na kahi si ntsadahitswe na munu yoyuve, ila ntsanuchilye kuhuma kwa Yesu Chilisito mwene yo angubulye. <verse eid="GAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Henye mwanga muhuliche hila fyo ntsavaga iho hamutalo hontsavaga ntsing'acha mu ntsovelo tsa Chiyawudi. Muntsela hila fyo ntsavakodaga ndalahela vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito, ntsaditaga ihyo kwa ludali lukomi na kujela kulyananga nachene litumbilo lyawo. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Heni ntsendelye ndalahela mu ntsovelo tsangu tsa Chiyawudi kulutila Vayawudi wolofu wo twavaga litsika limwe, kwakuva ntsavaga nanahye ndalahela ntsovelo tsa vadada vangu. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Lechelelo Mulungu yo avaga ambisile chang'ani na kwa lusungu lwake, anyagwe ntsive mutantsi vake luhuma ntsing'acha kuleleka, ili ntsimutumichile. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Ihyo avaga kulamula mwene kuta heni ntsimutsele Mwanage hila fyoali, ili ntsitsivikule Ndongwa Nofu kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi. Heni sitsaputsanitse kwa munu yoyuve, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />na sintsakwinile kubita ku Yelusalemu ngiwone na vala wo vavaga valongwe kuva vatumi, ila ntsahele ku inyi ya Alabiya, na kaha ngawuyaje ku Damesichi. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Hambele hojavaga kulutila myaka jidatu ngapilukaje ku Yelusalemu ili ngiwone na Petulo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chijilichi lintambulwa Chefwa. Ili lyo litawa linji lya Petulo.</char></note>. Ngikalaje hamwe nayo kwa siku kumi na tsihanu, <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />lechelelo singamuwene mutumi yunji yoyuve, ila Yakobo mudodove va Yesu.<verse eid="GAL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Mutselaje wukweli nachene halutalo ha Mulungu kuta, icho cho ntsinguvandichila siyo cha wudesi.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Hambele ngabitaje ku mikova ja Siliya na Chilichiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Luvala ulo vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito wo vavaga ku Wuyawudi sivavaga vantsele. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Vene vavaga vahuliche kuta, “Munu yula yo avaga angutukoda iho hamutalo, sambi angutsivikula ndongwa tsa litumbilo lililaga lyo ajelaga kulyananga.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Duve, vakamutsumitsaje Mulungu kwasawuli ya heni.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Pawulo angidichilwa na vatumi vayage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Hojavaga kulutila myaka kumi na jitayi, ngabitaje kaha ku Yelusalemu hamwe na Balinaba, ngamutegulaje na Tito ili tubitase hamwe nayo. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Ntsahele uko kwasawuli Mulungu avaga andonje kwa nduntsuchilo kuta ntsin'ganika kubita, ngavalonjelaje kwa wufiho vala wo vavaga vatumi tsila Ndongwa Nofu tso ntsavikwe kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi. Ntsadisile ihyo kwa kogopa kuta katsi yangu yo ntsin'dita yileche kuva yilihela mana. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Vakidichilaje kuva na heni, nambe muyangu Tito yo avaga Mujilichi na siavaga inje likumbi hoavaga kufika ku Yelusalemu, vatumi sivamugwagwaditse kwinjila likumbi, <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />nayivaje kwavaga na vanu wo viditaga kuta vamutumbye Chilisito wo vaganaga Tito injile likumbi. Vanu iwo vihantsitse kwa wusugu vatuhime ndalahela wuhulu wetu wo tunawo kwa kula kihantsa na Chilisito Yesu, ili hambele vatudite tuve tuvapogotsi va malanjitso ga Musa, <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />lechelelo tukalemaje nachene kidichila hila fyo van'gana vene nambe lulongwa lumwe, ili wukweli wa Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu wusigale na henye.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Filongotsi iwo wo vahemilwaga hilo sivakambwilye mahotso gogave. Kweli vahesimilwaga hilo, lechelelo kwa heni siyo chinu chochive, kwasawuli Mulungu si ahigaga kwa kulola kumiho kwa munu. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Tebe na ihyo, vakatselaje kuta Mulungu avaga anumile kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi kota hila Petulo fyo avaga atumilwe kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu kwa Vayawudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Mulungu yula yo amudisile Petulo ave mutumi kwa Vayawudi, yo yuyo yo andisile na heni ntsive mutumi kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Ihyo Yakobo, Petulo na Yohana, vawonekaga kuta wo vavina va chikundi cha vanu vanya litumbilo, hovavaga kutsela kuta Mulungu anantsile ntsive na wuwuya uwo, vakidichilaje kuta heni na Balinaba tubite kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi, na vene vave kwa Vayawudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Ila vakatulonje lulongwa ulu kuta tuviwukaje vagayu, na heni mbeye ntsingikangatsa kuludita lulongwa.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo angumung'anulila Petulo ku Andiyochiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Hala Petulo ho avaga kutsa ku muji gwa Andiyochiya ngasumanaje nayo halutalo ha vanu, kwasawuli avaga akosye nachene. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Hamutalo vanu wo vavaga vatumilwe na Yakobo hovavaga vang'acha kufika hono iho, Petulo avaga angihanga kulya na vanu wosi Vayawudi. Lechelelo vanu iwo hovavaga kufika akantsaje kikwega na vanu wosi Vayawudi kwasawuli wogopaga Vayawudi vala wo vavagwagaditsaga vanu vinjile likumbi. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Vayawudi vanji vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito nawo vakaludichilaje lulongwa lula lwa chipitupitu lo aditaga Petulo, nambe Balinaba nayo akakwegwaje na lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Lelo ho ntsavaga kuwona kuta chila cho van'dita si chili sava na wula wukweli wa Ndongwa Nofu fyo tsin'gana, ngamulonjelaje Petulo halutalo ha vanu veka kuta, “Heve uli Muyawudi na ungikala kota vanu wosi Vayawudi, na sinambeufwate ntsovelo tsa Chiyawudi. Kwasawuli yachi mun'jela kuvagwagwaditsa vanu wosi Vayawudi vafwate ntsovelo tsa Chiyawudi?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi na vanu wosi Vayawudi vakuluswaga kwa litumbilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Wukweli kwa kuleleka tuli Vayawudi siyo kota, “Vanu va inyi tsinji wo Vayahudi wo vavachemaga kuta vana ndongwa ntsibi.” <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Tung'acha tun'tsela nachene kuta munu siafuluche adite kota fyo an'gana Mulungu kwa kugafwata malajitso ga Musa, ila kwa kumtumba Yesu Chilisito. Ihyo na hetwe Vayawudi natwe tumutumbye Chilisito Yesu ili twidichilwe halutalo ha Mulungu, kwasawuli kuduhu munu yoyuve yo afuluche adichilwe na Mulungu kwa ng'olwa na kwa kibata malajitso ga Musa. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Ino lelo manyi tun'gana kidichilwa na Mulungu kwa kihantsa na Chilisito hetwe tukuwoneka kuta tuna ndongwa ntsibi. Mbe, vanu sivafuluche kuhotsa kuta Chilisito anguvatanga vanu kudita ndongwa ntsibi? Ndaya Chilisito siali ihyo ndaya. <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Manyi ndeche kugafwata Malajitso ga Musa ili ntsidichilwe na Mulungu, na hambele kaha ntsan'tse kugafwata Malajitso ga Musa. Nguva ntsingilajila nachene kuta heni mwene ntsina ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Kwa kukolela kwa malajitso ga Musa heni ntsafweye, yandisile ntsifwe ili ntsive mumi kwasawuli ya Mulungu. Heni fweye mumusalaba hamwe na Chilisito. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Ihyo ntsili mumi, ihyo siyo heni, ila ntsingikala ila Chilisito yo mumi mugati mwangu. Wumi wo ntsinawo sambi wuhumye mu litumbilo lya Chilisito Mwana va Mulungu, yo anganile mbaka akitawulaje wumi wake kwasawuli ya heni. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Sinambe ntsiwuleme wuwuya wa Mulungu, kwasawuli manyi wuwuya wuka wuve wupatikanaga kwa kugafwata malajitso ga Musa, duve chifo cha Chilisito chilihela mana yoyive.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Kumutumba Chilisito awu kugafwata Malajitso ga Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Nyee vanu va ku Galatiya wo muli vapufi, nani yo avahavye? Henye wo ndongwa tsa Yesu Chilisito kuvambwa mumusalaba tsawoniche bila wufiho halutalo henyu. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Ntsin'gana mundonjele lulongwa lumwe. Mbe, mwanuchilye Muhe va Mulungu kwasawuli ya kukwitsa ng'olwa tsa malajitso ga Musa, awu kwa kuhulika na kutsitumba Ndongwa Nofu ya Mulungu? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Mbe, henye muveye muli vapufi chinya ndawuli? Hamutalo henye mwantsitse wumi wenyu wupya kwa kutangwa na Muhe va Mulungu, lelo sambi mun'gana kusinda kwa ludali lwa mivili jenyu? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Mbe, ndongwa tsila tseka tsa ng'odeko ngomi tso tsavapasile henye tsiveye bule hela? Nachene siyo ihyo ndaya. <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Mbe, mwene Mulungu yo avapelaga vanu Muhe vake na kudita mitinuso hagati henyu, kwasawuli munhulikitsa malajitso ga Musa, awu kwa kuhulika na kitumba chila cho mwahuliche?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Mumwihukaje Ibulahimu hila fyo amutumbye Mulungu, na Mulungu akamudichilaje kwa kutumba kwake. <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Duve lelo, mutselaje kuta vanu vanya litumbilo, nachene iwo wo vana va Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Mandiko ga Mulungu mwanga gavaga gamuvikulye Ibulahimu Ndongwa Nofu luhuma katali kuta, “Kukolela kwa heve, Mulungu akuvadita vanu wosi Vayawudi vave vawuya halutalo ha Mulungu.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Ihyo vala vanu veka wo vanya litumbilo vidichilwaga kwa Mulungu hamwe na Ibulahimu yo avaga na litumbilo.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Vala veka wo vangihuvila kukuluswa kwa ndongwa tsa malajitso ga Musa iwo vakotulwe na Mulungu. Yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu, “Akotwiche chila munu yo sinambeatsikwitse ndongwa tseka tso tsandikwe mu chitabu cha Malajitso ga Musa.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Duve wukweli wuli hino, kuduhu munu yoyuve yo afuluche adichilwe halutalo ha Mulungu kwa kugafwata malajitso ga Musa, kwasawuli yandikwe, “Munu muwuya akikala kwa litumbilo.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Lechelelo malajitso ga Musa sigatsitse kwa litumbilo ndaya, kota hila Mandiko ga Mulungu fyo ganlonga, “Munu yo an'dita kota malajitso fyo gan'gana, akikala kwa kugahuvila Malajitso igo.”<verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Chilisito atugombwe kuhuma mu ng'otolo ya malajitso ga Musa kwa kuyitegula ng'otolo iyo kwajili ya hetwe, kwakuva Mandiko ga Mulungu ganlonga, “Akotwiche munu yula yo anvambwa mu musalaba.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Chilisito atugombwe ili ndongwa tsa wuwuya tso apasile Ibulahimu, vapataje na vanu va inyi tsinji kukolela Chilisito Yesu, ili kwa litumbilo twanuche Muhe vake yo avaga atulonje kuta akutupela.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malajitso ga Musa na Lilagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Nyee vang'olotsangu, ntsin'gana ntsivalonjele muhwano kuhuma mu ndongwa tso tun'dita chila chimunyi. Muhotsaje kuta vanu vavili vilajine, manyi vanu iwo vakuva vilajine duve kuduhuli munu yo afuluche abene awu kuwila chinu chochive mu lulongwa lula lo mwanga valajine. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Hohihyo na Mulungu nayo fyo avaga alajine na Ibulahimu na lulelo lwake. Mandiko ga Mulungu sinambegalonje, “Kwa chilelo chake” Kulajila kuta vanu wolofu, ila ganlonga “Kwa lulelo lwake” Chinya kutijila munu yumwe, nayo yo Chilisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Ntsin'gana kulonga kuta, Mulungu alongwe kudita nachene lilagano lyake na Ibulahimu, hambele myaka miya ine na salasini gakatsaje malajitso ga Musa. Ihyo malajitso igo sigafuluche gabene awu kubadila chila cho Mulungu avaga alajine na Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Manyi chifunje cha Mulungu chihuvilaga malajitso ga Musa, duve sichifuluche chihuvile lilagano. Lechelelo Mulungu kwa wuwuya wake amupelye Ibulahimu chila chifunje kukolela chila cho avaga alajine nayo.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Lelo kwasawuli yachi kuveye na malajitso? Malajitso gawilitwe iho kwasawuli ya kulajila kuta ndongwa ntsibi cho chinu chachi, mbaka ho alava kutsa yula va lulelo lwa Ibulahimu yo atambulwe kuta yo muhali va chila cho alontsile Mulungu. Mulungu akamupelaje malajitso igo mutantsi vake va kilanga, nayo akamupelaje Musa, na Musa akavapelaje vanu. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Ihyo mupatanisi si aganikaga manyi lulongwa lwene lwa kupatanisa luveye lwa lubali lumwe, na Mulungu nayo yo yumwe yo avisile lilagano na Ibulahimu bila kumutuma yunji yoyuve.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Katsi ya malajitso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Mbe, malajitso gasumwanaga na lila lilagano lya Mulungu? Ndaya! Kwasawuli manyi yika yive malajitso gafuluche gavapele vanu wumi, ihyo tuka kudichilwa na Mulungu kukolela kwa malajitso igo. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Lechelelo Mandiko ga Mulungu mwanga galontsile, vanu veka va inyi vali mu wimilitsi wa ndongwa ntsibi, ihyo lelo vala veka wo vangumutumba Yesu Chilisito, vakwanuchila chila cho avaga alontsile Mulungu.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Hala hotwavaga tung'ali kumutumbila Chilisito, malajitso gavaga gatudisile tuve kota vapogotsi, twatsindaga litumbilo ilyo ligubulwe. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Ihyo malajitso ga Musa gatulongwitse mbaka hala hoatsitse Chilisito, ili tudichilwe halutalo ha Mulungu kukolela litumbilo. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Lechelelo kwakuva lila litumbilo mwanga litsitse, ihyo lelo hetwe sambi situli mu wimilitsi wa malajitso.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Ihyo lelo henye nyeka muveye vana va Mulungu kwa litumbilo, kwa kihantsa na Chilisito Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Henye nyeka yo mubatitswe mwihantsise na Chilisito, na munkuva mwihwanile na Chilisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Ihyo haduhu wubagulo wowuve kwa Muyawudi na wosi Vayawudi, awu kwa mupogotsi na munu yo simupogotsi, na kwa mulume awu mudala. Henye nyeka munkuva chinu chimwe kwa kula kihantsa na Chilisito Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Henye muli vanu va Chilisito, duve henye munkuva lulelo lwa Ibulahimu, mukwanuchila chila cho avalonje Mulungu kuta akuvapela.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Duve lelo ntsin'gana ntsivalonjele kuta munya kuhala manyi ave ang'acha mwana mudodo, angihwana na mupogotsi naivaje mwene yo muhali va finu fyeka. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Luvala ho anguva ang'acha mudodo, avaga mu wimilitsi wa vanu vanji mbaka hala ho akuva akalaje na kufisa luvala lo luvisilwe na dade. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Hohihyo na hetwe hotwavaga kota vana vadodo, twavaga tuvapogotsi twalongotswaga na ntsovelo tsa inyi yino. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Lechelelo hala holwavaga kukwila luvala lo lwaganikaga, Mulungu amutumile Mwanage mu inyi. Akatsitse kota Mwana yo aleliche na mudala na akakalagalilaje mu wimilitsi wa malajitso ga Musa, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />ili avagombole vala veka wovali muwimilitsi wa Malajitso ga Musa, adisile ihyo ili na hetwe Vayawudi tuditwe vana va Mulungu.<verse eid="GAL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Sambi henye muveye vana vake, Mulungu amutumile Muhe va Mwanage munumbula tsenyu, nayo yo angumuchema Mulungu, “Abba” Chinyakutijila Dada vetu. <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Hoihyo, henye simuli vapogotsi ndaya, ila muli vanage. Kwakuva muli vana, Mulungu akukupela fyeka fyo avaviche vanage.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo anguvagongola Vagalatiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Hamutalo ho mwavaga simumutsele Mulungu, mwavaga muli vapogotsi kwa kufugamila milungu jo javaga siyo Mulungu va wukweli. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Lechelelo sambi kwasawuli mumutselye Mulungu, awu tufuluche tulonje kuta nayo Mulungu avatselye henye hilo, yiveye ndawuli kaha mun'gana kugapiluchila ntsovelo tsa hamutalo tso tsilihela wumi wa chimuhe? Mun'gana gavadite muve mu vapogotsi kanji? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Mung'acha munkwiwuka na kugadita mawungo ga siku, na myetsi, na misimu, na myaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Icho cho chin'mela muhwehwe kwasawuli ya henye kuta, katsi yontsadisile yifuluche yive kuta yiyatsile bule hela.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Nyee vang'olotsangu, ntsinguvagongola muvaje kota heni, na mulekaje kuva vapogotsi va Malajitso ga Musa, kota na heni hotsavaga kwa henye. Hontsavaga kwa henye simukanditye lulongwa lubi loluve. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Mun'kwiwuka kuta hamutalo hotsavaga ntsitsitse kwenyu kwasawuli tsavaga mutamwa. Iho hontsantsitse kuvalonjela henye Ndongwa Nofu. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Nambe ihyo tsavambutse mukolele mu majetso, henye si mwambede wala kundonga fibi. Ila mwandibulitse kota mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu, mwantsanuche heni kota hila Chilisito Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Hala hamutalo mwavaga na wuhechelelo lelo sambi chinu chachi cho chivapatite? Fuluche ndonje chila chontsachiwene kuta luvala lula kukakuve na wupefu, mukakukolopola miho genyu na kumela heni. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Mbe, sambi heni mbeye ntsimutelani venyu kwasawuli ya kuvalonjela wukweli?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Iwo vanu vanji wo vana chimuhemuhe na henye mutselaje kuta mu numbula tsawo vana mahotso mabi, ila van'gana vavalekanitse na hetwe, ili henye muvagatsichichile vene. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Kulonga wukweli ntsin'wona finofu kuvagatsichila vanu vanji kwa lulongwa lunofu, siyo mbaka heni mbaje ntsilihamwe na henye ng'ani. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Nyee vanangu, ntsinguvawonela wusungu wa kota mudala yo antamika wusungu luvala lulia ho an'gana kulela mwana, ntsin'gatsika kwa wusungu kwajili yenyu mbaka hala ho mukuva kota Chilisito fyoali. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Ntsinguvagongola na ntsingiwiniwa kuta ntsika ntsive hamwe na henye sambi, ntsika kubadila litsi lyangu ili live lya wudeche. Kwakuva ntsina mahotso molofu ndalahela kwasawuli ya henye.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa Hajili na Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Mundonjele henye yo mun'gana kulongotswa na malajitso ga Musa. Mbe, sinambemuhuliche malajitso igo fyo ganlonga? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Kwakuva mu Mandiko ga Mulungu ganlonga kuta Ibulahimu avaga na vana vavili, yumwe aleliche na mudala yo avaga mupogotsi, na mwana va kavili aleliche na mudala yo avaga siyo mupogotsi. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Lechelelo mwana va mudala mupogotsi aleliche kwa mbwiniyo tsa muvili, lechelelo yula yunji va mudala yo siavaga mupogotsi aleliche kota hila fyo avaga avalonje Mulungu kuta akuvapela. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Ndongwa tsino tsifuluche tsive kota muhwano, kwasawuli iwo vadala vavili go muhwano gwa malagano gavili. Lilongola lyo lila lyolyadisilwe ha Chidunda cha Sinayi, lyolyaletsile vana va wupogotsi. Ilino lyo uyo mudala Hajili. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Hajili ankuva muhwano gwa Chidunda cha Sinayi cho chili ku inyi ya Alabiya, na cho chihwana na Yelusalemu ya sambi yo yili kuwupogotsi hamwe na vana vake. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Lechelelo Yelusalemu ya kilanga kwa Mulungu go muji go siguli mu wupogotsi, ugo go muhwano gwa yuvetu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Kwakuva mu Mandiko ga Mulungu yandikwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">“Uhechelele, heve yo uli mende.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Ukolaje heve yo ulihela wusungu wa kulela mwana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Kwakuva vana va mudala yula yo alesilwe, wo wolofu kulutila vana va mudala yula yo atoliche.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Lelo henye vang'olotsangu, henye muna kota fyo yali kwa Yisaka, muli vana vala wo alontsile Mulungu kuta akumupela Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Siku tsila yula mwana yo aleliche kwa bwiniwo tsa muvili, amusovaga yula yo aleliche kwa wuvetso wa Muhe va Mulungu, ho hihyo fyo yili mbaka sambi. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Lechelelo Mandiko ganlonga ndawuli? Ganlonga hino, “Umuhetse mudala mupogotsi hamwe na mwanage, kwasawuli mwana va mudala mupogotsi si afuluche ahale hamwe na mwana va yula mudala yosi mupogotsi.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Ihyo lelo vang'olotsangu, hetwe situli vana va mudala mupogotsi, ila tuli vana va yula mudala yosi mupogotsi.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Wuhulu mugati mwa Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Chilisito atupelye wuhulu, aganaga tusigale wuhulu hihyo. Lelo mwikangatsaje na mwalahogola kaha kuwuya mu wupogotsi wa Malajitso.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Muhulikitse! Heni yo Pawulo yo ntsinlonga na henye. Manyi mwidichile kwinjila likumbi kwasawuli ya kugafwata Malajitso ga Musa, Chilisito siakuvafwaya chinu chochive. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Kaha ntsinguvalonjela wukweli chila munu yo angidichila kwinjila likumbi, uyo an'ganika kibata Malajitso geka ga Musa. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Manyi mungihuvila kidichilwa halutalo ha Mulungu kukolela malajitso ga Musa, ihyo mukuva mwivisile kutali na Chilisito, na kaha muli kutali na lusungu lwa Mulungu. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Kwasawuli kwa wuvetso wa Muhe va Mulungu hetwe tungihuvila kwa litumbilo kidichilwa na Mulungu kukolela kwa Chilisito. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Duve manyi twihantsitse na Chilisito Yesu, kwinjila likumbi awu manyi sitwinje likumbi siyo chinu, lechelelo kudita finu kwa wugano ko kulajilaga litumbilo lyo tunalyo.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Hamutalo mwavaga mun'dita finofu mulitumbilo! Lelo nani yo avalemitse muleche kuwudichila wukweli? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Yo avambwitse muleche kudita ihyo, siyo Mulungu yo avachemile henye. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Madahitso gano ga wudesi gana kota hamila ndodo fyo yitsatsamulaga wuse wolofu! <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Kwa kihantsa kwenyu na Mutwa, ntsina lihuvilo likomi kuta henye simukuva tebe na heni kwa chila cho ntsivadahitsa. Munu yoyuve yo akuvayatsa nambe avaje munu vachi, uyo an'ganika kuhigwa.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Henye vanya litumbilo vayangu manyi heni ntsing'acha ntsinguvavikulila ndongwa tsa kwinjila likumbi, kwasawuli yachi ntsing'acha ntsinkodwa? Manyi ntsikatsive ntsing'acha ntsidahitsa lulongwa lwa kwinjila likumbi, wujumbe wangu wa chifo cha Chilisito mumusalaba siwukakuvadesa Vayawudi. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Yikakuva chiba iwo wo vanguvatifya kwa ndongwa tsa kwinjila likumbi vaka vihutule vave vachiliti!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Henye vanya litumbilo vayangu mwachemilwe na Mulungu ili muve na wuhulu, lechelelo wuhulu uwo mulekaje kuwutumila kwa mbwiniwo tsa ndongwa tsa mu inyi, ila mwitangaje henye kwa henye kwa wugano. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Malajitso geka ga Musa gakwitswaga kwa kufwata yino amuli yimwe, “Umugane munu vako va habehi kota fyo ungigana heve mwene.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Lechelelo manyi mwilalatule na kwidakula kota minyama ja mwijejele, mwiyangalile mulekaje kiyananga.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kikala kwa kulongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Ihyo ntsinlonga kuta mwikale kwa kulongotswa na Muhe, na ihyo fyo mufuluche mutsisume mbwiniwo ntsibi tsa mivili jenyu. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Muvili gwiwiniwaga ndongwa tsotsili tebe na Muhe, nayo Muhe va Mulungu iwiniwaga ndongwa tsila tso sinambegugane muvili jenyu. Lelo Muhe va Mulungu na muvili fisumwanaga, na kwasawuli ihyo simukuvetsa kudita fyo mun'gana henye. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Manyi mulongotswe na Muhe va Mulungu, duve mukuva simunlongotswa na Malajitso ga Musa.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Duve ng'olwa tsa muvili tsin'tselanika tso itsi, waafu, na kuvasa na mulume awu mudala vanji, na udita ndongwa tsa nyoni, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />kujifugamila misanamu, na wuhavi, na mabatu, na mbafya, na mbipi, na wupunganitsi, na chitika, na wusongapisi, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />kuwona mbafya, na wugatsi, na wuhatufu na ndongwa tsinji tsotsihwana na itso. Ntsinguvafunda kanji kota fyo ntsalongwe kuvafunda kuta, vanu wovan'dita ndongwa kota itso, nachene sivakwinjila mu Wuntsajila wa Mulungu.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Munu yo anlongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu avaga na wugano na wuhechelelo na wusichimafu, na wukangatso, na wuwuya, na kitanga na kuhuvilwa, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />wudeche na kiyangalila yu mwene. Kuduhu Malajitso go gakisuma na ndongwa kota itso. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Vala wo vihantsitse na Chilisito Yesu vagavambite mahotso gawo hamwe na mbwiniwo tsawo mu musalaba gwa Chilisito. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Muhe va Mulungu atupelaga wumi, duve twidichilaje kulongwatswa na mwene. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Tulekaje kidutsa bule hela, na kuno tungisova na kiwonela mbafya.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Twikangatsaje na kwitanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Nyee vanya litumbilo vayangu, manyi mumuwone munu mutunga anantsile lulongwa, duve henye yo munlongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu mumufundaje munu uyo na kumupilula kwa numbula ya wugano. Lechelelo mwiyangalilaje, muleche kwiyingitsa mumajetso ga kudita ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Mwitangaje henye kwa henye na ihyo homukukwitsa malajitso ga Chilisito. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Manyi munu iwone kuta alichinu, na kumbe si ali chinu ndaya, uyo angideteletsa mwene. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Lechelelo chila munu ihime mwene, iho ho afuluche itsumile mwene mugati mu numbula yake ng'ani bila kihwanitsa na munu yunji. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Kwakuva chila munu akuhigwa kwa chila cho avaga adisile.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Munya kudahitswa ndongwa tsa Mulungu, nayo aganikaga amupelaje na mudahitsi vake finu finofu fyo afipatite.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Mulekaje kideteletsa, Mulungu si aditilwaga mbedatsi. Chila cho adisile munu cho chicho cho akuditilwa na mwene. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Yula yo an'dita ndogwa tsa mbwiniwo tsa muvili gwake akupata mahombo ga wananjifu, lechelelo mwene yo akudita kwa kulongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu, uyo akupata wumi wo wugaya wudugo <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Duve, tulekaje kufulugala kudita wuwuya, kwasawuli manyi tuleche kufulugala tukuhombwa wuwuya na Mulungu. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Ihyo hala ho tunkuva tung'acha tunalo luvala, tuvaditile wuwuya vanu veka, lechelelo tun'ganika tuvaditile hilo vala vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito vayetu.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongwa tsa kusindilitsa na samuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Mulave hila fyo ntsandiche kwa ntsandiko ngomi, kwa liwoko lyangu ntsi mwene. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Vala wo van'gana kuwoneka vawuya kwa ndongwa tsa muvili wo van'gana kuvananahitsa henye mwinjile likumbi. Van'dita ihyo kwasawuli van'gana vatyeje kukodwa kwasawuli kuvikula ndongwa tsa musalaba gwa Chilisito. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Nambe vala wovinje likumbi sinambevagadichile Malajitso ga Musa, vanguvagana henye mwinjile likumbi ili vidutse kwasawuli ya ndongwa itso tsa kuvingitsa likumbi. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Ila kwa heni Mulungu akunugitsile kutali lulongwa ulo, kwasawuli singuhogola ntsidutsile chinu chochive kulutila chifo cha musalaba gwa Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito. Kukolela kwa mwene Chilisito, ndongwa tseka tsa muinyi tsilihela fwayida yoyive kwa heni, na ndongwa tsangu tsa katali tsifweye na Chilisito mumusalaba. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Kwinjila awu kuleka kwinjila likumbi si chinu ndaya, lechelelo kula kuva chiwumbe chipya cho chila chinu cho chin'ganika! <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Wusichimafu wuvaje na veka wo wanfwata wulongotso wuno wupya, kaha na lusungu luvaje kwa vanu va Mulungu va inyi ya Isilaheli.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Luhuma sambi munu yoyuve alekaje kunindasa, kwasawuli mbisilwe ng'ofu tsa mu muvili gwangu tso tsinlajila kuta heni ntsili mutantsi va Yesu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Nyee vanya litumbilo vayangu, lusungu lwa Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito luvaje na henye nyeka. Tavile!<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>